From 5e65da4db4010e9f882005f8cd562fd2a43f2237 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kryxzort <101042137+Kryxzort@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:49:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 085/117] particle: remap ranges as vectors, the stock
 operators' blend-in
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

remapvalue / remapinitialvalue's output ranges may be "x y z" (WE's parser keeps the vector
and the float form): a colour output now ramps per component (the stock previews map the
distance to a control point to red … blue; they drew black). blendinstart / blendinend, which
the stock capvelocity and remapvalue set, weight the operator's effect over the particle's life
(inferred: a clamped ramp, full when unset).

Origin: ours
Why: docs/player/spikes/we-coverage.md F6 (WE's particleelementpreviews, old vs new)
Status: candidate-for-upstream
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../Render/Objects/CParticleStock.cpp         | 60 +++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 47 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/core/WallpaperEngine/Render/Objects/CParticleStock.cpp b/src/core/WallpaperEngine/Render/Objects/CParticleStock.cpp
index 67eb342..e1f2d9f 100644
